WEBVTT

00:43:29.288 --> 00:43:32.163
So talk about that structure
of how you win.

00:43:32.163 --> 00:43:36.204
Microsoft presumably have invested not
purely for altruistic purposes.

00:43:36.246 --> 00:43:40.079
They think that they will make money
on that billion dollars.

00:43:40.246 --> 00:43:42.621
I sure hope they do. I love capitalism,

00:43:42.663 --> 00:43:46.913
but I think that I really loved even
more about Microsoft as a partner.

00:43:46.913 --> 00:43:50.371
And I'll talk about the structure
and the exclusive license in

00:43:50.371 --> 00:43:53.496
a minute is that we like went around
to people that might find us.

00:43:53.496 --> 00:43:56.496
And we said one of the things here is that
we're going to try to make you some

00:43:56.496 --> 00:43:59.496
money. But like Adjei going
well is more important.

00:43:59.496 --> 00:44:02.079
And we need you to sign this document
that says if things don't go